{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valor Hunters is a co-op action roguelike with twin-stick combat, peer to peer teamwork abilities, and 15 to 20 minute replayable missions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>A New Spin on the Co-Op Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for chaotic sessions with friends, Valor Hunters blends bullet hell intensity with physics-driven teamwork mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/15e52a4ff81c1c108f229806417fefdb.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/15e52a4ff81c1c108f229806417fefdb.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Replayable Chaos Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short 15\u201320 minute missions with random augments and procedural maps. Perfect length for casual drop-ins or all-night marathons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/43a186c163493bc0ce0f80ffe341681b.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/43a186c163493bc0ce0f80ffe341681b.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Hero Variety That Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hunter brings unique powers plus a peer to peer skill that shines only in co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/87fdeec799e1ca1017f3e915c156e6e7.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/87fdeec799e1ca1017f3e915c156e6e7.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Bullet Hell Meets Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge swarms, aim precisely, and layer abilities into chaotic combos. Every fight feels like organized chaos on the edge of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/4e893f1ad7810889bb460a4b612251e3.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/4e893f1ad7810889bb460a4b612251e3.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Progression Without Grind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock variants and augments  that change playstyle. Dash becomes Blink, Supers ignite, weapons morph into new tactics. No +1% stat treadmills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/c76c1ed7f5bc346fbfa1f65ee5ca9e3d.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/c76c1ed7f5bc346fbfa1f65ee5ca9e3d.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Galaxy Worth Saving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join eccentric rebels in a vibrant sci-fi world fighting an oppressive mega corporation. Humor and charm make every failure fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/af8fa4c054faff1e63a0a73c1bbbc61e.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1560 height=781 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the progression of Hades, the chaos of Risk of Rain 2, or the teamwork of Helldivers, Valor Hunters will be your next obsession.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist today and join the rebellion.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605090?t=1765124257","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605090?t=1765124257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/2e0aa47a35b8f4deb8cced1809f35cbf652334e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765124257","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/2e0aa47a35b8f4deb8cced1809f35cbf652334e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765124257","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/971f4305880786427076b36d4fd411ce.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valor Hunters is a co-op action roguelike with twin-stick combat, peer to peer teamwork abilities, and 15 to 20 minute replayable missions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>A New Spin on the Co-Op Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for chaotic sessions with friends, Valor Hunters blends bullet hell intensity with physics-driven teamwork mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/15e52a4ff81c1c108f229806417fefdb.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/15e52a4ff81c1c108f229806417fefdb.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Replayable Chaos Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short 15\u201320 minute missions with random augments and procedural maps. Perfect length for casual drop-ins or all-night marathons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/43a186c163493bc0ce0f80ffe341681b.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/43a186c163493bc0ce0f80ffe341681b.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Hero Variety That Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hunter brings unique powers plus a peer to peer skill that shines only in co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/87fdeec799e1ca1017f3e915c156e6e7.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/87fdeec799e1ca1017f3e915c156e6e7.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Bullet Hell Meets Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge swarms, aim precisely, and layer abilities into chaotic combos. Every fight feels like organized chaos on the edge of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/4e893f1ad7810889bb460a4b612251e3.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/4e893f1ad7810889bb460a4b612251e3.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Progression Without Grind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock variants and augments  that change playstyle. Dash becomes Blink, Supers ignite, weapons morph into new tactics. No +1% stat treadmills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/c76c1ed7f5bc346fbfa1f65ee5ca9e3d.poster.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/c76c1ed7f5bc346fbfa1f65ee5ca9e3d.webm?t=1765124257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Galaxy Worth Saving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join eccentric rebels in a vibrant sci-fi world fighting an oppressive mega corporation. Humor and charm make every failure fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/af8fa4c054faff1e63a0a73c1bbbc61e.avif?t=1765124257\" width=1560 height=781 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the progression of Hades, the chaos of Risk of Rain 2, or the teamwork of Helldivers, Valor Hunters will be your next obsession.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist today and join the rebellion.</strong></h2>","developers":["HALE Gameworks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/3384f60a963554a48df5e112c6d8143e672ab6fd/header.jpg?t=1765124257","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1+) or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro